:Heisenbergmodelhamiltonian rdf:type owl:Class ;
                            rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                              owl:onProperty :hasScaleLevel ;
                                              owl:hasValue :Atomisticscale
                                            ] .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#Heisenbergspinhamiltonian
:Heisenbergspinhamiltonian rdf:type owl:Class ;
                           rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                             owl:onProperty :hasScaleLevel ;
                                             owl:hasValue :Atomisticscale
                                           ] .


