:Kpointresolvedmae rdf:type owl:Class ;
                   rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                     owl:onProperty :hasScaleLevel ;
                                     owl:hasValue :Electronicscale
                                   ] .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#KronmüllerEquation
:KronmüllerEquation rdf:type owl:Class ;
                    rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/emmo#MaterialLaw> ;
                    rdfs:comment "The Kronmüller equation is a semiempirical constitutive expression for coercivity incorporating microstructural factors (α, Deff) to relate intrinsic magnetic properties to macroscopic coercive field; it is an emmo:MaterialLaw linking material parameters to a key permanent magnet performance quantity, and no existing pm: or magmo: class captures this coercivity-microstructure relation."@en ;
                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> ;
                    rdfs:label "kronmüller equation" ;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "kronmüller equation"@en .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#L10mnga
:L10mnga rdf:type owl:Class ;
         rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                           owl:onProperty :hasProperty ;
                           owl:someValuesFrom <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/magnetic-material#UniaxialMagnetocrystallineAnisotropy>
                         ] .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#Ldaplusdmft
:Ldaplusdmft rdf:type owl:Class ;
             rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                               owl:onProperty :hasScaleLevel ;
                               owl:hasValue :Electronicscale
                             ] .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#Ltpmnbi
:Ltpmnbi rdf:type owl:Class ;
         rdfs:subClassOf [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
