:TwoSublatticeMeanFieldModel rdfs:comment "The two-sublattice mean-field model describes RE-TM magnetic coupling via molecular field coefficients and is directly used to compute temperature-dependent magnetisation in PM materials; it is IN_SCOPE and a GAP because emmo:AtomisticModel has no sub-class for sublattice mean-field exchange models."@en ;
                             rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> ;
