:TwoSublatticeMicromagneticModel <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "What is the two-sublattice micromagnetic model used for? — to describe the magnetic excitation spectrum including acoustic, optic, and crystal-field modes"@en .


:VacuumPermeability <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "What is vacuum permeability used for? — used as a fundamental constant in the magnetic equations"@en .


